# Route: guide 26 of 50 of the simulator's completionist route for Skyborne
# (1539 of 1546 eligible quests, 166.6 h, world baeac23fbe5e): levels 46 to
# 48, 36 quests, 2.4 h under the model. The order is the simulator's (`sim run
# --objective completionist`, then `sim export`; docs/SIMULATION.md §10): fix
# a step in the exporter or the data, not only here, so the next export keeps
# it.
#
# Flow (Stranglethorn Vale, Swamp of Sorrows, Tanaris): Booty Bay -> Wild
# Shore -> Ruins of Aboraz -> Booty Bay -> Wild Shore -> Booty Bay -> Wild
# Shore -> Ruins of Zul'Mamwe -> Mistvale Valley -> Nek'mani Wellspring ->
# Booty Bay -> Splinterspear Junction -> Steamwheedle Port -> ….
#
# Optional (elite: grouping up is advised): The Monogrammed Sash (620;
# Mok'rash 50); The Captain's Chest (8551; Gorlash 47); The Captain's Chest
# (614; Gorlash 47); Facing Negolash (618; Negolash 52); The Monogrammed Sash
# (8552; Mok'rash 50); Facing Negolash (8554; Negolash 52); The Super Snapper
# FX (2944; Gammerita 48).
#
# Left to other guides: class quests (the Class category); dungeon quests (the
# Dungeons guides): Divino-matic Rod (2768), Scarab Shells (2865), Troll
# Temper (3042), Into the Depths (3446), Secret of the Circle (3447), The
# Prophecy of Mosh'aru (3527), The God Hakkar (3528), The Final Tablets
# (4788).

